        "maelthor": "hit",
        "worship": "retriever_gap",
        "cult": "hit"
      },
      "stale_hits": [],
      "global_stale_hits": [],
      "answer": "TL;DR: The Shepherds (Shepherd\u2019s Flock) are a cult-like group actively recruiting and agitating in the city, and they serve or are aligned with **Maelthor** and his influence.\n\nThe \u201cShepherds\u201d refers to the **Shepherd\u2019s Flock**, a protest-leading cult faction currently active at the city gates (CANON). They are not just demonstrators\u2014they are **actively recruiting**, especially targeting \u201ctransformed individuals,\u201d and framing their actions as part of a larger mission (CANON + OBSERVED).\n\nThey **answer to Maelthor** (OBSERVED: faction = followers of Maelthor), and their beliefs center on advancing his influence. Their doctrine frames violent or extreme acts as **\u201cnecessary sacrifices for the greater good\u201d** and as a way to **cleanse impurities resisting Maelthor\u2019s influence** (CANON + OBSERVED). They also push an ideology of **human supremacy** (CANON).\n\nPublicly, they mask their actions as defensive or tragic necessities, but internally they are organized, ideological, and expansionist.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Faction: Followers of Maelthor (OBSERVED)\n- Role: Cultists staging protests and recruiting (CANON)\n- Goals: Spread Maelthor\u2019s influence; recruit transformed individuals; enforce \u201ccleansing\u201d ideology (CANON)\n- Alignment Context: Justify harmful acts as sacrifices for Maelthor (OBSERVED)\n- Activity: Active protest and covert operations (CANON + OBSERVED)",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
      "id": "q_the_city_council_2",
      "question": "Who speaks for the wizards on the council, and what's his angle on the cult?",
      "strict_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "semantic_verdict": "pass_updated",
      "must_hits": [
        "headmaster tinkerbright",
        "wizard's college",
