      "answer": "TL;DR: Torrin represents the Guilds as Master Smith, Rurik oversees infrastructure as Chief Architect, and Merril\u2019s council role is not defined in the provided context.\n\nTorrin Flamescale  \n- Job: Representative of the Guilds; Master Smith  \n- Source: OBSERVED role and title confirm he speaks for the craft guilds in council matters.\n\nRurik Stonehammer  \n- Job: Representative of Infrastructure; Chief Architect  \n- Source: CANON role + OBSERVED title align\u2014he is responsible for the city\u2019s structural integrity and infrastructure decisions.\n\nMerril  \n- Job: Not specified in the projection context  \n- There are no CANON, PREP, or OBSERVED facts identifying Merril\u2019s council position, so this cannot be determined from current data.\n\nKey Attributes  \n- Governance: Council includes faction representatives (e.g., Guilds, Infrastructure).  \n- City Concerns: Defense integrity, cult activity via tunnels, and crisis response (tainted meat, lockdown planning).",
      "embedding_similarity": null
    },
    {
