      "answer": "TL;DR: The Council Chambers ended Session 12 **disheveled**, after a **Fireball lit up almost the entire room** and **magical defenses (runes and illusory walls) activated**, altering the space mid-encounter.\n\nDuring Session 12 (OBSERVED):\n- The room\u2019s **physical condition is now \u201cDisheveled.\u201d**\n- A **Fireball** \u201calmost the entire room is lit up by Fireball,\u201d implying widespread scorch/damage.\n- **Runes along the walls activated when Caelynn cast her spell**, changing how the chamber functioned.\n- **Illusory Walls** and other **ancient defensive wards** became active, dynamically altering the layout and battlefield.\n\nThese changes reflect a shift from a formal deliberation space into an active, hazardous magical environment.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Physical Condition: Disheveled (OBSERVED)\n- Defenses: Activated runes, illusory walls, ancient wards (OBSERVED)\n- Atmosphere: Fireball-lit, chaotic, high tension (OBSERVED)\n- Geography: Large circular chamber with central table and hidden trapdoor (OBSERVED, unchanged but impacted)",
