      "answer": "TL;DR: The Wolf is **dead** at end of Session 12 \u2014 specifically **\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body.\u201d** He was previously corrupted (oily sheen, erratic behavior), but no evidence shows that corruption was resolved before death.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Physical Condition (OBSERVED): **\u201cDecapitated; head removed from body\u201d;** had **\u201can oily sheen to his eyes\u201d** prior to death; had also turned **Invisible** and taken major damage earlier.\n- Operational Status (OBSERVED): Attempted escape via invisibility and secret passage; ultimately overtaken during pursuit.\n- Mental State (OBSERVED): Desperate, regretful, **begging to be killed**, indicating awareness of corruption.\n- Faction / Alignment (OBSERVED): Cultist; betrayed Mirathorn; acting as saboteur.\n- Related Event (OBSERVED \u2013 Bonogo): **Removed the Wolf\u2019s head to transport it**, confirming the killing blow outcome.\n\nConclusion: Despite earlier escape attempts and invisibility, the final, most definitive state is death by decapitation. Corruption was present up to that point and not cured.",
